e description\n\nWhen adding a \"Slot\" `StyleBox` theme override to `GraphNode`, the `StyleBox` will be drawn properly on the sides but not on top/bottom, instead stretching the `Control` within the slot if possible. \n\nBelow are two simple `GraphNode`s with a single `ColorRect` (for visibility) with a minimum size `50,50`. The one on the right has a `StyleBox` which has `5px` hot pink margins on all sides. \n\n<img width=\"288\" height=\"170\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae3c9c4c-6221-4446-87f6-2cbf295ef11c\" />\n\nAs you can see, not only do we not see the top & bottom margins, it instead stretched the `ColorRect` to be `60px` tall. \n\nI would expect it to instead draw the stylebox fully:\n\n<img width=\"292\" height=\"172\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/28de25c0-7b99-4c85-874b-fa581757eff9\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create `GraphNode`\n2. Give it a \"slot\" `StyleBox` theme override with vertical components\n3. Add child\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[graph-node-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29167745/graph-node-mrp.zip)\n\nWarning: This MRP works in 4.7. I tried opening it in 4.0 & 4.5 and it crashed the editor. I don't know why. The bug was reproduced on those versions with version-specific MRPs which are the exact same scene. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"ht